            <ArticleTitle>Endoscopic treatment of tracheo-oesophageal fistulae: an innovative procedure.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1093/mmcts/mmw015</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">mmw015</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Tracheo-oesophageal fistulas represent a major complication of prolonged intubation and may cause death. Surgical repair is a complex procedure that can be challenging in compromised patients. In this study, we describe a simple endoscopic technique that resulted in the effective palliation of symptoms.</AbstractText>
